TI  - AI-Driven IoT-Enabled Precision Agriculture: Optimizing Resource Usage with LoRaWAN and Drone-Based Monitoring
T2  - 2025 International Conference on Data Science, Agents and Artificial Intelligence, ICDSAAI 2025
