AB  - - By utilizing an IoT-based platform this project proposes a novel approach to traditional farming that will enable real time monitoring and personalized advisory services for crop management. By utilizing sensors to measure soil moisture, pH, nutrient levels temperature and humidity the system gathers essential environmental data that is processed and transmitted via an ESP32 controller to a cloud database for analysis. The platform offers tailored guidance on irrigation fertilizer usage and crop development providing farmers with precise information. Moreover, it supports postharvest decisions by providing profit/loss analysis and marketing strategies, supporting sustainable and efficient farming. This integrated solution is a simple mobile app and dashboard interface that enhances crop yield optimizes resource use and facilitates smart agriculture from sowing to sale. The integration of drones yield forecasting with AI based artificial intelligence and localized voice guidance makes this platform indispensable in modern precision agriculture. © 2025 IEEE.
